&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Project or software documentation&lt;/strong>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Online courses&lt;/strong>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>Tutorials&lt;/strong>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>The parent folder may be renamed, for example, to &lt;code>docs&lt;/code> for project documentation or &lt;code>course&lt;/code> for creating an online course.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>To disable this feature, either delete the parent folder, or set &lt;code>draft = true&lt;/code> in the front matter of all its pages.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>After renaming or deleting the parent folder, you may wish to update any &lt;code>[[menu.main]]&lt;/code> menu links to it in the &lt;code>config.toml&lt;/code>.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Authors</title><link>https://www.bhavinjawade.github.io/author/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.bhavinjawade.github.io/author/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Slides</title><link>https://www.bhavinjawade.github.io/slides/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.bhavinjawade.github.io/slides/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>